### Test 7 — Plan máximo (dolly_pro) baja de plan (downgrade) y pierde acceso a idiomas no activos
@baseUrl = http://localhost:57011/api/v1
@email = qa-test7-{{$timestamp}}@example.com
@password = QaPassword123!

### 7.1 Registrar y activar plan máximo dolly_pro (acceso abierto a los 4 idiomas)
# @name reg
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "fullName": "QA Pro Downgrade"
}

@token = {{reg.response.body.data.tokens.accessToken}}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/subscription
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tier": "dolly_pro"
}

###
PUT {{baseUrl}}/settings/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categories": ["neurociencia", "technology", "history"]
}

### Configurar prioridad explícita para futuro downgrade: 1º Italiano, 2º Francés, 3º Español, 4º Inglés
PUT {{baseUrl}}/settings/languages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "languages": ["it", "fr", "es", "en"]
}

### 7.2 En dolly_pro puede generar en cualquiera de los 4 idiomas -> 201 Created
# @name rProFr
POST {{baseUrl}}/readings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "neurociencia",
  "language": "fr",
  "difficulty": "medium",
  "size": "short"
}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/readings/{{rProFr.response.body.data.id}}/evaluate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userResponse": "Le texte décrit le rôle des synapses dans l'apprentissage."
}

### 7.3 Baja a dolly_plus (quedan activos los 2 primeros: ['it', 'fr']) -> 201 Created
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/subscription
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tier": "dolly_plus"
}

### Francés sigue activo -> 201 Created
POST {{baseUrl}}/readings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "neurociencia",
  "language": "fr",
  "difficulty": "easy",
  "size": "short"
}

### Inglés se perdió al bajar de plan -> 403 SUBSCRIPTION_LANGUAGE_NOT_ALLOWED
POST {{baseUrl}}/readings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "neurociencia",
  "language": "en"
}

### 7.4 Baja a dolly básico (solo queda activo #1: ['it'])
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/subscription
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tier": "dolly"
}

### Italiano (idioma principal) funciona -> 201 Created
POST {{baseUrl}}/readings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "neurociencia",
  "language": "it",
  "difficulty": "easy",
  "size": "short"
}

### Francés, Español e Inglés ahora devuelven 403 SUBSCRIPTION_LANGUAGE_NOT_ALLOWED
POST {{baseUrl}}/readings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "neurociencia",
  "language": "fr"
}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/readings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "neurociencia",
  "language": "es"
}

### Intentar promover 'es' al puesto #1 sin pago -> 403 LANGUAGE_CHANGE_LOCKED
PUT {{baseUrl}}/settings/languages/reorder
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "languages": ["es", "it", "fr", "en"]
}
